   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "2025 年 12 月，Anthropic 发布 SCONE-bench，收录 405 个历史上被利用过的真实合约。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 12 月，Anthropic 发布 SCONE-bench，收录 405 个历史上被利用过的真实合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 3.18,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 3.18,
   "speechEnd": 11.582
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "对模型知识截止之后才出事的那批合约，智能体在模拟环境里能盗取的金额，合计约 460 万美元。",
   "spoken": "对模型知识截止之后才出事的那批合约，智能体在模拟环境里能盗取的金额，合计约 460 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 12.04,
   "dur": 10.0,
   "speechStart": 12.04,
   "speechEnd": 21.855
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "扫描新部署的 BSC 合约时，它发现了 2 个此前未知的漏洞，其中一个后来被攻击者真实利用。",
   "spoken": "扫描新部署的 BSC 合约时，它发现了 2 个此前未知的漏洞，其中一个后来被攻击者真实利用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 22.26,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 22.26,
   "speechEnd": 30.171
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "这些测试全部在模拟器里进行。",
   "spoken": "这些测试全部在模拟器里进行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 30.64,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 30.733,
   "speechEnd": 33.27
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "另一些基准给出的数字更冷静。",
   "spoken": "另一些基准给出的数字更冷静。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 33.66,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 33.66,
   "speechEnd": 36.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "EVMbench 和后续复评里，最佳检测率约 46%。",
   "spoken": "EVMbench 和后续复评里，最佳检测率约 46%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 36.44,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 36.44,
   "speechEnd": 41.019
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "在 22 起真实事件上，没有一组智能体完成端到端的利用。",
   "spoken": "在 22 起真实事件上，没有一组智能体完成端到端的利用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 41.46,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 41.552,
   "speechEnd": 46.277
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "AI 在降低利用漏洞的成本，但在真实的复杂系统上，仍明显弱于基准表现。",
   "spoken": "AI 在降低利用漏洞的成本，但在真实的复杂系统上，仍明显弱于基准表现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 46.72,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 46.823,
   "speechEnd": 52.773
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "对防守方来说，最确定的影响是，修复要更快。",
   "spoken": "对防守方来说，最确定的影响是，修复要更快。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 53.18,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 53.18,
   "speechEnd": 57.289
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "AI 写的代码，同样会出错。",
   "spoken": "AI 写的代码，同样会出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 57.72,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 57.818,
   "speechEnd": 59.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "2026 年 2 月，Moonwell 上线新的价格包装器，cbETH 只取了它对 ETH 的汇率，漏乘 ETH 的美元价格。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 2 月，Moonwell 上线新的价格包装器，cbETH 只取了它对 ETH 的汇率，漏乘 ETH 的美元价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 60.18,
   "dur": 10.08,
   "speechStart": 60.18,
   "speechEnd": 70.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "cbETH 被定价成约 1.12 美元，引发大量清算，留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "spoken": "cbETH 被定价成约 1.12 美元，引发大量清算，留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 70.48,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 70.48,
   "speechEnd": 78.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "相关提交里，有 AI 编程助手署名的共同作者。",
   "spoken": "相关提交里，有 AI 编程助手署名的共同作者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 79.26,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 79.26,
   "speechEnd": 83.09
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "项目方没有把事故归因于 AI，人类同样会犯这个错。",
   "spoken": "项目方没有把事故归因于 AI，人类同样会犯这个错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 83.56,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 83.654,
   "speechEnd": 88.29
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "2025 年 7 月，一个假的 Solidity 扩展上架插件市场，一名区块链开发者被盗约 50 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 7 月，一个假的 Solidity 扩展上架插件市场，一名区块链开发者被盗约 50 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 88.74,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 88.74,
   "speechEnd": 96.638
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "模型还会编出不存在的包名，攻击者抢先注册，这叫幻觉包名。",
   "spoken": "模型还会编出不存在的包名，攻击者抢先注册，这叫幻觉包名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 97.04,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 97.04,
   "speechEnd": 103.209
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 报告称，攻击者借助一个内部 AI 工具，控制了另外两名钱包工程师的电脑。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 报告称，攻击者借助一个内部 AI 工具，控制了另外两名钱包工程师的电脑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 103.58,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 103.684,
   "speechEnd": 111.79
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "工具名称和机制，Binance 没有公开。",
   "spoken": "工具名称和机制，Binance 没有公开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 112.2,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 112.2,
   "speechEnd": 114.903
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "AI 也能帮防守方，做大范围初筛，起草测试，给告警分诊。",
   "spoken": "AI 也能帮防守方，做大范围初筛，起草测试，给告警分诊。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 115.3,
